    package: "11.8 LPA",
    avatar: "/Candidate_Image/pratiksha_jetking_sap_fico-modified.png",
    quote: "The 1-on-1 resume preparation and technical mock interviews gave me the confidence needed to clear corporate placement drives. I am extremely grateful for the continuous guidance."
